      the end of that period and do not roll over. One-time top-ups do not renew, and unused purchased credits
      carry forward separately from your subscription. There are no automatic top-ups or overage charges.
    </p>
    <p>
      Codium credits measure usage of Codium's models; they are not a promise of a fixed number of tokens,
      requests, completed tasks or successful results. Token figures are estimates using the stated assumptions.
      Actual consumption varies with the selected model, input and output, reasoning, conversation history,
      repeated project context, tool use and the number of agents or model calls. Large tasks and parallel agents
      can consume credits quickly. Your displayed balance may lag requests still being processed. Review usage
      and model selection in your account and supervise automated work. Access pauses when the available
      allowance cannot cover a request; additional use requires available credits or a new purchase you authorize.
    </p>
    <p>
